---
---

<section class="viewport-section steps-viewport-section" id="como-funciona">
  <div class="steps-container">
    
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="steps-header">
      <h2 class="steps-title">
        Três passos. Nenhuma fricção.
      </h2>
      <p class="steps-subtitle">
        Desenhado especificamente para a rotina dinâmica de fisioterapia e reabilitação.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 3 Core Steps Row -->
    <div class="steps-grid">
      
      <!-- Step 01 -->
      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-card-header">
          <div class="step-icon-wrap">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
              <line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"></line>
              <line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"></line>
              <line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"></line>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="step-number">01</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="step-card-title">Agende & Receba na Recepção</h3>
        <p class="step-card-desc">
          O paciente preenche a anamnese no celular via link seguro de WhatsApp. Na recepção, o relógio de 4 cores indica na hora quem chegou, quem está na espera e quem está atrasado.
        </p>
        <button 
          type="button" 
          class="step-more-btn" 
          data-open-feature-modal="semiotica"
          title="Ver como funciona o relógio de 4 cores na recepção"
        >
          <span>🟢 Como funciona o relógio de 4 cores? →</span>
        </button>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 02 -->
      <div class="step-card step-card-featured">
        <div class="step-card-header">
          <div class="step-icon-wrap icon-featured">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path>
              <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline>
              <line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"></line>
              <line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"></line>
              <polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="step-number">02</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="step-card-title">Atenda ao Lado da Maca</h3>
        <p class="step-card-desc">
          Preencha com uma mão só na Thumb Zone. Cronômetro integrado, régua EVA de dor e o botão mágico "+ Evoluir da última": o registro que levava 10 minutos é feito em menos de 60 segundos.
        </p>
        <button 
          type="button" 
          class="step-more-btn" 
          data-open-feature-modal="thumb-zone"
          title="Ver o botão Evoluir da última e a usabilidade com uma mão só"
        >
          <span>⚡ Por que a evolução leva menos de 60s? →</span>
        </button>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 03 -->
      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-card-header">
          <div class="step-icon-wrap">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <rect x="1" y="4" width="22" height="16" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
              <line x1="1" y1="10" x2="23" y2="10"></line>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="step-number">03</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="step-card-title">Receba & Fidelize</h3>
        <p class="step-card-desc">
          Dedução automática de sessões de pacotes na finalização, controle visual de inadimplência pelo cifrão ($), histórico de absenteísmo e contato direto no WhatsApp sem salvar o número na agenda.
        </p>
        <button 
          type="button" 
          class="step-more-btn" 
          data-open-feature-modal="auto-anamnese"
          title="Ver a integração de WhatsApp e auto-anamnese"
        >
          <span>💬 Conversas no WhatsApp em 1 clique →</span>
        </button>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Central Featured Action Button -->
    <div class="steps-action-bar">
      <button 
        type="button" 
        class="btn btn-pill btn-action-deep" 
        data-open-feature-modal="thumb-zone"
      >
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon>
        </svg>
        <span>Conheça as principais funcionalidades</span>
      </button>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .steps-viewport-section {
    background-color: #0d1f3c;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #091322 0%, #0d1f3c 60%, #0b172a 100%);
    color: #ffffff;
    min-height: 100vh;
    min-height: 100dvh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: clamp(4.5rem, 8vh, 6rem) clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .steps-container {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .steps-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 780px;
    margin-bottom: clamp(2.5rem, 5vh, 4rem);
  }

  .steps-title {
    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 3.8rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .steps-subtitle {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.6vw, 1.2rem);
    color: #94a3b8;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  /* 3 Grid Columns */
  .steps-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(1.25rem, 2.5vw, 2.5rem);
    width: 100%;
    margin-bottom: clamp(2.5rem, 5vh, 3.5rem);
  }

  .step-card {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-radius: 1.5rem;
    padding: clamp(1.75rem, 3vh, 2.25rem);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    text-align: left;
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    transition: transform 250ms ease, border-color 250ms ease, background 250ms ease;
  }

  .step-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
    border-color: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3);
  }

  .step-card-featured {
    background: rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.08);
    border-color: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.25);
  }

  .step-card-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .step-icon-wrap {
    width: 46px;
    height: 46px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    color: #38bdf8;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .icon-featured {
    background: #0284c7;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .step-number {
    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .step-card-title {
    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .step-card-desc {
    font-size: 0.925rem;
    color: #cbd5e1;
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .step-more-btn {
    font-size: 0.825rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #38bdf8;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-align: left;
    padding: 0;
    transition: color 150ms ease;
  }

  .step-more-btn:hover {
    color: #7dd3fc;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  /* Action Bar */
  .steps-action-bar {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .btn-action-deep {
    background: #ffffff;
    color: #0d1f3c;
    border: 1.5px solid #ffffff;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 0.85rem 2.25rem;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
  }

  .btn-action-deep:hover {
    background: #f1f5f9;
    border-color: #f1f5f9;
    transform: scale(1.03);
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .steps-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }
    .step-card {
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
